# Controls: small/medium factor degrees, several distinct factors, an even n,
# an inseparable psi (p | n) and a case where the factors all have equal degree.
ecdivpoly y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97 5
ecdivpoly y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97 3
ecdivpoly [1,1] mod 101 60
ecdivpoly [1,1] mod 101 59
ecdivpoly [0,4] mod 7 7
ecdivpoly [1,1] mod 97 8
